CcipDepositReconciliation
└── when CCIP delivers less than the Parent sent
    ├── it should emit the post-CCIP amount from ChildVault
    ├── it should forward that event amount to Parent completion
    ├── it should reduce the epoch share allocation and total shares
    ├── it should make the epoch claimable
    ├── it should mint only the reconciled shares
    └── when the vendored CCIP token pool charges a transfer fee
        └── it should reconcile shares to the pool-released destination amount
